+ * stays pending for a later multiplier or matrix. Unused bypassable ops are
+ * bypassed; unused non-bypassable matrix/multiplier/LUT ops are programmed to
+ * an identity; a non-bypassable curve has no identity and rejects the plan.
+ * Among complete plans the fewest LUTs wins (named curves are exact). */
+static void plan_node(struct plan_search *s, size_t ni, size_t oi, double gain, unsigned cost) {
